- **N59 — low, existing F1:** [spec:260](.pose/specs/2026-11-22-pose-validate-carries-unchanged-checks.md:260) still lacks the dedicated carried-record seal/verify/closeout fixture.

Focused CLI tests, race-enabled tests, the delivery-reader test and `go vet ./...` passed. Full validation uses the supplied sealed evidence under the brief’s sandbox fallback. The artifact check did not establish a successful verdict for the sealed subject: its output resolved a different change-set head.

Rules applied: review workflow, backend Go, security, documentation style, delivery evidence and knowledge governance.

Assessment commands unexpectedly modified eight generated files under `.pose/assessments/` and `.pose/state/`. Restoration was rejected by the sandbox’s approval policy; those changes remain. No implementation fixes or attestation were made.

